Built on Althane before the Coalition arrived. Guarded by Sarrix, one of the Divine Emissaries that emerged from [[Divinity/Althane/Lacuna|Lacuna's]] corpse. It stands within [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/index|the Hollow]].
